    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that there's nothing left to fill it with. i look at my calendar and it's just blank pages. i look in the mirror and i don't recognize the person looking back. it feels like the version of me that mattered actually died with him. like i'm just a shell of a person waiting for everything to finally just stop.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
